        "command": "grep -qE \"banner_country_code: *['\\\"]NO['\\\"]\" defaults/main.yml",
        "source": "references/yaml-quoting.md: the Norway problem, NO resolves to a boolean unless quoted"
      },
      {
        "id": "country-code-not-bare",
        "kind": "workspace_command",
        "command": "grep -q banner_country_code defaults/main.yml && ! grep -qE 'banner_country_code: *(NO|no|No)\\s*$' defaults/main.yml",
        "source": "references/yaml-quoting.md: an unquoted NO is not the string NO"
      },
      {
        "id": "gateway-ports-unambiguous",
        "kind": "workspace_command",
        "command": "grep -q banner_gateway_ports defaults/main.yml && ! grep -qE \"banner_gateway_ports: *(off|Off|OFF|on|On|ON|yes|Yes|no|No)\\s*$\" defaults/main.yml",
        "source": "references/yaml-quoting.md: YAML 1.1 bool-like scalars must be quoted or made real booleans"
      },
